olmOCR-bench subset (benchmark/datasets/olmocr)

This directory contains a derivative of olmOCR-bench
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/olmOCR-bench, revision
54a96a6fb6a2bd3b297e59869491db4d3625b711) by the Allen Institute for AI (AI2).

olmOCR-bench is made available under the Open Data Commons Attribution License v1.0
(ODC-BY-1.0): https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/
Full text: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/index.html

This derivative database (a 40-document subset whose unit tests were converted into the
PuffinParse rule schema by benchmark/adapters/olmocr.py) is likewise made available under
ODC-BY-1.0. The intended use of the upstream data is research and education, in accordance
with AI2's Responsible Use Guidelines: https://allenai.org/responsible-use

The individual PDF pages keep the rights of their original publishers; each document's
original `source_url` is recorded in manifest.json.

Citation: Poznanski et al., "olmOCR: Unlocking Trillions of Tokens in PDFs with Vision
Language Models", arXiv:2502.18443 (2025).
